pages.terratern.com hosts several other landing pages and can't move
to this project without breaking them. Proxying /linkinbio.html to
this deployment now happens from terratern-ads-landing-page's own
vercel.json instead (a rewrite to this project's full URL), so this
project needs no domain-specific rewrite of its own.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LHzxqv9S6k47oG19wZF3Kx
---
 vercel.json | 7 -------
 1 file changed, 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/vercel.json b/vercel.json
index aec7901..c29018c 100644
--- a/vercel.json
+++ b/vercel.json
@@ -1,11 +1,4 @@
 {
-  "rewrites": [
-    {
-      "source": "/linkinbio.html",
-      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "pages.terratern.com" }],
-      "destination": "/linktree.html"
-    }
-  ],
   "functions": {
     "pages/api/cron-simple.js": {
       "maxDuration": 300
